## 动画布局过渡

### AnyLayout 切换

`AnyLayout` 可以在不同布局之间进行带动画的切换：

```swift
struct LayoutTransitionView: View {
    @State private var isGrid = false

    var body: some View {
        let layout = isGrid
            ? AnyLayout(GridLayout(columns: 3))
            : AnyLayout(FlowLayout(spacing: 12))

        VStack {
            layout {
                ForEach(0..<9) { index in
                    RoundedRectangle(cornerRadius: 8)
                        .foregroundStyle(.blue.gradient)
                        .frame(width: 60, height: 60)
                        .overlay {
                            Text("\(index)")
                                .foregroundStyle(.white)
                                .bold()
                        }
                }
            }
            .animation(.spring(response: 0.5), value: isGrid)

            Button(isGrid ? "切换为流式" : "切换为网格") {
                isGrid.toggle()
            }
            .padding(.top)
        }
        .padding()
    }
}
```

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    subgraph "布局动画切换"
        A["Layout A"] -->|"AnyLayout + animation"| B["Layout B"]
        B -->|"AnyLayout + animation"| A
    end

    subgraph "视图保持标识"
        C["子视图 identity 不变"]
        D["位置平滑过渡"]
        E["尺寸平滑过渡"]
    end

    B --> C
    C --> D
    C --> E
```

> **提示：** `AnyLayout` 切换时，子视图的**标识保持不变**，因此 SwiftUI 可以对位置变化应用平滑动画，而不是销毁和重建视图。

